# Whitelist only build inputs. Never send NAS credentials, logs, datasets,
# virtualenvs, archives, or runtime secrets to the Docker build context.
**
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.wsl
!requirements.txt
!constraints.wsl.txt
!app/
!app/**
!tools/
!tools/init_wsl_database.py
app/**/__pycache__/
app/**/*.pyc
